lied, text on the next line does not have kerning applied\nActual: kerning is being applied to pixel fonts space character causing the newline to be positioned outside the bounds of the label\n\n<img width=\"695\" height=\"301\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30c9ad6b-e429-4557-a84d-65956bc9c50b\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen MRP and select Label component, note the characters are outside the bounds of the Label\n\nSteps I took to build MRP: \n1. Create a pixel font\n2. Set up a kerning pair for the space character:\n```\n\\u0020 !\"#$%&'()*+,-./0123456789:;<=>?@ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ[\\]^_`abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz -10\n```\n3. Create a Label\n4. Set Autowrap Mode to Word\n5. Set the Label's font to the pixel font created in step 1\n6. Set Text to large amount of text to force word wrapping\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[pixel-font-space-kerning-word-wrap-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23560778/pixel-font-space-kerning-word-wrap-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"http